  "harness_contract": {
    "dnsResolver": "Harness-owned fixture forwards to authoritative UDP case.port and fills settings.clientExport.resolvers before panel add/export; copied main-client response remains unchanged. hostname uses e2e.test with bootstrap127.0.0.1. TLS uses existing fixture cert/key and caPem with serverName=e2e.test.",
    "interCheckDelaySeconds": "Requested short drain between independent checks only for maxStreams1 to avoid measuring intentional capacity rejection as throughput failure."
  },
  "scope_note": "All12 original cases plus all TLS fingerprints for both inner types over DoT/DoH and hostname UDP bootstrap; no public resolvers. Remaining rejection/limit/lifecycle cases are covered by centrally executed core suite."
